<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Still at times I sense the shadows</l><l>Of my nature, untransformed;</l><l>Lord, I’ll go unto the mountain,</l><l>To Thy death to be conformed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>On the mountain till the daybreak,</l><l>Linger I, Lord, thus with Thee,</l><l>May Thy all-transforming Spirit</l><l>Saturate me thoroughly.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Mingled with Thee on the mountain,</l><l>Soon my sun begins to shine;</l><l>Death has worked her deep impression,</l><l>Now my nature’s one with Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
